3 "(c) Project – Cloud Seeding: Wind River and Sierra Madre
4 mountain ranges 2026 (ground-based):
5
6 (i) Project sponsor: The state of Wyoming;
7
8 (ii) Project purpose: To enhance the winter snowpack in
